WEBVTT

00:27:29.948 --> 00:27:34.043
I would say that,
in the areas we're discussing,

00:27:34.067 --> 00:27:36.760
using large amounts of data

00:27:36.784 --> 00:27:42.918
and having some data being accessible
by companies or governments,

00:27:42.942 --> 00:27:46.355
and having some data
being exposed to the world,

00:27:46.379 --> 00:27:52.505
I think is a better fit for societies
which are more collectivist in nature,

00:27:52.529 --> 00:27:55.823
and are viewed as a big problem

00:27:55.847 --> 00:27:57.840
and looked at with paranoia

00:27:57.864 --> 00:28:01.932
in societies that are more
about individualism.